  "Specification": "A buffered random access file implementation that maintains an in-memory buffer over a disk-backed file. Proves refinement of the RandomAccessFile abstraction via INSTANCE with substitutions mapping logical file content and cursor. Specifies invariants relating buffer contents to logical file state, correctness of each operation, and conditions under which Inv2 can always be restored.",
